        "EV012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FR-003",
      "title": "The live delivery adapter reads post-merge execution evidence only after GitHub reports the PR merged, preserves pending/red/unreadable distinctions, and feeds the same typed fact to both the lifecycle reducer and completion writer. (Stories: US-001, US-002; Acceptance: AC-002, AC-003, AC-004)",
      "text": "The live delivery adapter reads post-merge execution evidence only after GitHub reports the PR merged, preserves pending/red/unreadable distinctions, and feeds the same typed fact to both the lifecycle reducer and completion writer. (Stories: US-001, US-002; Acceptance: AC-002, AC-003, AC-004)",
      "acceptanceCriteria": [
        "AC-002",
        "AC-003",
        "AC-004"
      ],
      "priority": null,
      "classification": [],
