    {
      "id": "FR-006",
      "title": "Focused unit and live-adapter tests prove the inversion: PR-green plus merge/reachability but no qualifying branch run refuses all terminal writes, while adding the exact matching green run enables precisely the existing completion saga. (Stories: US-001, US-002; Acceptance: AC-005)",
      "text": "Focused unit and live-adapter tests prove the inversion: PR-green plus merge/reachability but no qualifying branch run refuses all terminal writes, while adding the exact matching green run enables precisely the existing completion saga. (Stories: US-001, US-002; Acceptance: AC-005)",
